  "notes": "Termination rates are published by Age and Service for Miscellaneous members in Table B-2 (Page 68). The target grid requires rates by Age (rows) and Service (columns). The source table provides exactly this structure. Target ages 25-65 map directly to source rows. Target age 70 maps to the last source row (65) as no older age is provided. Target service bins 1-4 map directly. Target service bins 6, 8, 10, 11, 12, 30, 40 all map to the source bin '5 or more' via copy, as the source does not differentiate beyond 5 years. Source values are percentages and will be converted to decimals by the code. No broadcast is needed as both dimensions are present in the source.",
